{"id": "msg_ef17b66941b44210a1e081f7e4074287", "role": "assistant", "parts": [{"type": "text", "text": "明白：**workbuddy 全量实测，cursor 暂缓**。\n\nworkbuddy 系共 14 个（含 workbuddy-ai/hy3）。已测过全量的 3 个（deepseek-v4.1-flash / glm-5.3-flash / hy3），已快筛的 4 个（v4-pro / space-bunny / glm-5.3 / minimax）。剩未测：**hy4free / glm-5.2 / kimi-k3.1-pro / kimi-k2.8-preview / step-5-preview / mimo-v2.6-pro**（6 个）。\n\n\"全量\"= 跑完整 35 题。我用现有 run-bench 全量套件跑这些 workbuddy 未测模型最规范（结果落 bench-full.json，scorer 可算）。但 run-bench 的 full 套件从 screen 通过者取模型，且 CANDIDATES 固定。我改用一个独立全量脚本跑这 6 个未测 workbuddy 模型 × 35 题，并发+日志+成本控制，结果单独存，不污染主 bench-full。\n\n先建 todo 并写全量脚本。"}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call_00_fkXVcA9f27sk2LIgkmEs2523", "tool_name": "todo_write", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"todos": [{"content": "列 workbuddy 全部模型，区分已测/未测", "status": "completed"}, {"content": "写 workbuddy 未测模型全量评测脚本（35题×6模型，并发+日志）", "status": "in_progress"}, {"content": "后台跑全量，半分钟监听进度", "status": "pending"}, {"content": "评分并汇总 workbuddy 全名单判定（可用/不行）", "status": "pending"}]}}], "created_at": "2026-11-14T04:16:27.081Z", "peer_id": "github.com-tyvt-skills"}
{"id": "msg_ebbec4286260402a96ee146fd9a770f3", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call_00_fkXVcA9f27sk2LIgkmEs2523", "tool_name": "todo_write", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Updated todo list: 2 pending, 1 in progress, 1 completed.\"}]", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_ebbec4286260402a96ee146fd9a770f3", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 84, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "2026-11-14T04:16:27.109Z", "peer_id": "github.com-tyvt-skills"}
{"id": "msg_510aca6e309f46bd87c4bcd8c707ba66", "role": "assistant", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call_00_9ukkw6Oft2tUst7pjx5U2556", "tool_name": "write", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"content": "import json, urllib.request, concurrent.futures, time, sys, os, re\nGW='http://127.0.0.1:3425/v1/chat/completions'\nTOOLS=\"\"\"可用工具（仅限此清单，不存在的工具禁止使用）:\n- file_reader: 摘要/整理\"已提供\"文本（无磁盘读取权限）。\n- code_editor: 生成或修改代码（纯文本，无磁盘读写权限）。\n- code_edit_with_signal: 有可执行验证手段的改码（需跑测试/修报错/按方案改/验证跑通）。\n- planner: 复杂任务的规划与推理。\n- image_analyst: 分析图像内容(截图/图表/照片)。\n- security_guard: 审查 pwsh / 写库参数，只输出 JSON。\n- summarizer: 汇总各步骤结果。\n- git: 本地只读 Git 摘要，只 git status --short 与 git diff --stat；不跑 pull/rebase/push/log。\n- pwsh: 把自然语言转成一条 PowerShell 命令并执行（读盘/跑构建/批量处理）。每步只做一件事。\n读磁盘只能用 pwsh；file_reader/code_editor/code_edit_with_signal 不能读写磁盘。\n只输出JSON: {\"route\":\"execute_tools|direct_answer|refuse\",\"analysis\":\"<=200字\",\"steps\":[{\"tool\":\"工具名\",\"intent\":\"做什么\",\"depends_on\":[],\"estimate_tokens\":0}],\"notes\":\"风险\"}\"\"\"\nBASE=r'D:\\repository\\skills\\controller-bench'\nd=json.load(open(os.path.join(BASE,'tasks-master.json'),encoding='utf-8'))\ntasks=d['tasks']\nmodels=['workbuddy/hy4free','workbuddy/glm-5.2','workbuddy/kimi-k3.1-pro','workbuddy/kimi-k2.8-preview','workbuddy/step-5-preview','workbuddy/mimo-v2.6-pro']\nOUT=os.path.join(BASE,'results','bench-workbuddy-full.json')\nstore={'rows':[]}\nif os.path.exists(OUT):\n    store=json.load(open(OUT,encoding='utf-8'))\nhave={(r['model'],r['task']) for r in store['rows'] if not r.get('error')}\n\ndef ask(m,pt):\n    body=json.dumps({'model':m,'temperature':0.2,'max_tokens':1500,'messages':[{'role':'system','content':TOOLS},{'role':'user','content':pt}]}).encode()\n    req=urllib.request.Request(GW,data=body,headers={'Content-Type':'application/json','Authorization':'Bearer x'})\n    sw=time.time()\n    try:\n        r=json.loads(urllib.request.urlopen(req,timeout=120).read())\n        return {'raw':r['choices'][0]['message']['content'],'ct':r['usage']['completion_tokens'],'ms':int((time.time()-sw)*1000)}\n    except Exception as e:\n        return {'error':str(e)[:80],'ms':int((time.time()-sw)*1000)}\n\njobs=[(m,t) for m in models for t in tasks if (m,t['id']) not in have]\nprint(f\"TODO {len(jobs)} combos ({len(models)} models x {len(tasks)} tasks, minus done)\",flush=True)\ndone=0\nwith concurrent.futures.ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=6) as ex:\n    futs={ex.submit(ask,m,t['prompt']):(m,t) for m,t in jobs}\n    for f in concurrent.futures.as_completed(futs):\n        m,t=futs[f]; res=f.result()\n        row={'model':m,'task':t['id'],'route_expect':t['route_expect'],**res}\n        store['rows'].append(row)\n        done+=1\n        if done%10==0 or 'error' in res:\n            odd=os.path.join(BASE,'results','bench-workbuddy-full.partial.json')\n            json.dump(store,open(odd,'w',encoding='utf-8'),ensure_ascii=False)\n            print(f\"[{done}/{len(jobs)}] {m} {t['id']} {'ERR:'+res['error'] if 'error' in res else 'ok '+str(res['ms'])+'ms'}\",flush=True)\njson.dump(store,open(OUT,'w',encoding='utf-8'),ensure_ascii=False)\nprint(f\"DONE total_rows={len(store['rows'])}\",flush=True)\n", "file_path": "D:\\repository\\skills\\.task-state\\bench_workbuddy_full.py"}}], "created_at": "2026-11-14T04:16:32.700Z", "peer_id": "github.com-tyvt-skills"}
