{"id": "msg_ebaf5248ab7d41a282bebbf93053094c", "role": "assistant", "parts": [{"type": "text", "text": "确认保留名单（6 个）：`workbuddy/deepseek-v4.1-flash`、`workbuddy/glm-5.3-flash`、`workbuddy/glm-5.3`、`workbuddy/space-bunny`、`workbuddy/kimi-k3.1-pro`、`workbuddy/deepseek-v4-pro`。\n\n跑**所有测试**（35 题：M1–M5 + T8–T11 + M6–M10）。其中 3 个已有旧 29 题数据（bench-full.json）、缺 M6–M10；3 个（glm-5.3/space-bunny/kimi-k3.1-pro）只有部分。最干净的做法：**6 模型 × 35 题全部重跑一遍**，结果单独存，口径统一、可复现，不与历史陈旧数据混淆。\n\n复用刚才的 workbuddy 全量脚本，改模型名单 + 输出文件。先建 todo。"}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call_00_Ljd3bMZQriTteNVgggv04254", "tool_name": "todo_write", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"todos": [{"content": "确定保留 6 模型名单", "status": "completed"}, {"content": "6 模型 × 35 题全量重跑（新脚本，独立结果文件）", "status": "in_progress"}, {"content": "后台跑 + 半分钟监听", "status": "pending"}, {"content": "评分汇总 6 模型排名 + 题型强弱", "status": "pending"}]}}], "created_at": "2026-11-14T05:00:40.837Z", "peer_id": "github.com-tyvt-skills"}
