{"id": "msg_73ff17e869c745ff81ef9fabbe39f0f5", "role": "assistant", "parts": [{"type": "text", "text": "评分完成。注意：`glm-5.3` 和 `glm-5.3-flash` 有较多 format_error（12、17 题）——它们的 avg 只算了解析成功的题，被高估。我核实这俩的 format_error 具体分布（是否又是代码块包裹）。"}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call_00_GdmTHqokApXx8wrVfo6S2817", "tool_name": "pwsh", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"command": "cd 'D:\\repository\\skills\\controller-bench'\npython -c @\"\nimport json\nrows=json.load(open('results/bench-workbuddy-final.json',encoding='utf-8'))['rows']\nfor m in ['workbuddy/glm-5.3','workbuddy/glm-5.3-flash','workbuddy/space-bunny','workbuddy/deepseek-v4-pro','workbuddy/kimi-k3.1-pro']:\n    fmts=[]\n    for r in rows:\n        if r['model']!=m: continue\n        if r.get('error'): continue\n        try: json.loads(r['raw'])\n        except: fmts.append(r['task'])\n    print(m,'fmt_tasks=',fmts)\n\"@", "description": "List format_error tasks per model"}}], "created_at": "2026-11-14T05:08:40.566Z", "peer_id": "github.com-tyvt-skills"}
