{"id": "msg_3300f9b7e0f0472c8b568ec6c853caf9", "role": "assistant", "parts": [{"type": "text", "text": "重要发现：`glm-5.3` 和 `glm-5.3-flash` 的 format_error 很多，且集中在**短答题**（M1-x、M4-3/M4-4/M4-5 直答/拒绝、M10 评审）——这俩模型倾向\"自然语言直接回答、不吐 JSON\"，正是 M1-1（读文件）本该 execute_tools 却可能直接答。这跟它们高 avg（只算成功行）形成误导。要看原始输出确认。\n\n同时 glm-5.3 的 M6-M10 几乎全是 fmt（M8/M9/M10 全 fmt）——说明它在新题上大量不吐 JSON。\n\n我核算**\"有效分\"**：把 format_error 记 0 分计入总分（这才是真实可用性），重排。"}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call_00_LciYYodFaJyL7BG5PDFS3344", "tool_name": "pwsh", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"command": "cd 'D:\\repository\\skills\\controller-bench'\npython -c @\"\nimport json,re,os,statistics\nBASE='.'\nd=json.load(open('tasks-master.json',encoding='utf-8')); tm={t['id']:t for t in d['tasks']}\nrows=json.load(open('results/bench-workbuddy-final.json',encoding='utf-8'))['rows']\ndef sc(r):\n    t=tm[r['task']]\n    if r.get('error'): return 0.0  # err 记0\n    try: p=json.loads(r['raw'])\n    except: return 0.0  # fmt 记0\n    if not p or not p.get('route'): return 0.0\n    steps=[s for s in (p.get('steps') or []) if s.get('tool')]\n    routeS=1.0 if p['route']==t['route_expect'] else 0.0\n    if t['route_expect']!='execute_tools': toolS=1.0 if len(steps)==0 else 0.0\n    elif steps:\n        s=sum(1.0 if st['tool'] in t['optimal_tools'] else (0.6 if st['tool'] in t.get('acceptable_tools',[]) else 0) for st in steps)\n        toolS=s/len(steps)\n    else: toolS=0.0\n    text=' '.join([p.get('analysis') or '']+[st.get('intent','') for st in steps]+[p.get('notes') or ''])\n    hit=sum(1 for pat in t['required'] if re.search(pat,text)); comp=hit/len(t['required']) if t['required'] else 1.0\n    eff=1.0 if t['route_expect']!='execute_tools' else (min(1.0,t['optimal_steps']/len(steps)) if steps else 0.0)\n    return round(0.35*toolS+0.25*comp+0.25*routeS+0.15*eff,3)\nfrom collections import defaultdict\nagg=defaultdict(list)\nfor r in rows: agg[r['model']].append(sc(r))\nprint('=== 有效总分（fmt/err 记0分 = 真实可用性口径）===')\nfor m,v in sorted(agg.items(),key=lambda z:-sum(z[1])/len(z[1])):\n    print(f'{m:30} effective_avg={round(sum(v)/len(v),3)}  (35题)')\n\"@", "description": "Effective score with format_error counted as 0"}}], "created_at": "2026-11-14T05:08:46.447Z", "peer_id": "github.com-tyvt-skills"}
